N=16 DYADIC INFINITY-CUSP RESIDUES
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Residues are units of (1/x)/2^depth modulo 16 for endpoints x.
  n16 d=2    abs_depths=5:34     unit_residues_mod16=1:2,3:5,5:6,7:4,9:4,11:6,13:5,15:2
  n16 d=4    abs_depths=6:68     unit_residues_mod16=1:6,3:11,5:10,7:7,9:7,11:10,13:11,15:6
